A Boolean function $f : \{0,1\}^n \to \{0,1\}$ has degree $\le d$ if its $\pm 1$
lift $(-1)^f$ has degree $\le d$ in the sense of \texttt{LowDegreeTest.is\_degree\_le\_pm1}.
\end{definition}

