For $p > 0$ and $f : \mathrm{BoolCube}\,(n+1) \to \mathbb{R}$,
\[
  \mathbb{E}\bigl[\left\lvert f\right\rvert^p\bigr]
  \;=\; \mathbb{E}_{x'}\Bigl[\tfrac12\bigl(\left\lvert f(\mathrm{snoc}(x',\mathit{false}))\right\rvert^p + \left\lvert f(\mathrm{snoc}(x',\mathit{true}))\right\rvert^p\bigr)\Bigr].
\]
