\leanok
\uses{BooleanAnalysis.BooleanFunc, BooleanAnalysis.influence, BooleanAnalysis.totalInfluence}

The total influence is the sum of the coordinate influences:
$I[f] = \sum_{i} \mathrm{Inf}_i[f]$.
