For every decision tree $T$ and every point $x$ of the Boolean cube,
\[
T.\mathrm{signEval}(x) = \sum_{S} \mathrm{coeffs}\,T\,S \cdot \chi_S(x).
\]
\end{lemma}

n21180.content:
\begin{lemma}[Coefficients vanish above the depth]
\lean{DecisionTree.coeffs_eq_zero_of_depth_lt}

