\leanok
\uses{BooleanAnalysis.boolToSign, DecisionTree, DecisionTree.coeffs, DecisionTree.depth}

If $T.\mathrm{depth} \le k$, then for every $S$ there is an integer $m$ with
$\mathrm{coeffs}\,T\,S \cdot 2^k = m$.
\end{lemma}

n21183.content:
\begin{lemma}[Granularity of the coefficients]
