\leanok
\uses{DecisionTree, DecisionTree.coeffs, DecisionTree.coeffs_mul_two_pow_int, DecisionTree.depth}

For every $S$ there is an integer $m$ with
$\mathrm{coeffs}\,T\,S = m / 2^{T.\mathrm{depth}}$; that is, every coefficient is an
integer multiple of $2^{-T.\mathrm{depth}}$.
\end{lemma}

n21184.content:
\begin{lemma}[Size bounded by $2^{\mathrm{depth}}$]
