For every $S$ there is an integer $m$ with
$\widehat{T.\mathrm{signEval}}(S) = m / 2^{T.\mathrm{depth}}$: every Fourier coefficient is
an integer multiple of $2^{-k}$, where $k$ is the tree depth.
