\begin{definition}[A minimum covering]
\lean{SimpleGraph.IsMinimumCovering}
\label{SimpleGraph.IsMinimumCovering}
\leanok
\uses{SimpleGraph.IsCovering}
Watch every edge using as few vertices as possible.  As with
\texttt{Subgraph.IsMaximumMatching}, minimality is spelled out by hand since Mathlib has
